+menu "Android"
+
+if ANDROID
+
+config ASHMEM
+	bool "Enable the Anonymous Shared Memory Subsystem"
+	depends on SHMEM
+	help
+	  The ashmem subsystem is a new shared memory allocator, similar to
+	  POSIX SHM but with different behavior and sporting a simpler
+	  file-based API.
